# tleap_1KS4.in
# 1KS4 endoglucanase A (A. niger, GH9), AMBER ff14SB + TIP3P -- same pattern as
# tleap.in (XYN WT) / tleap_Q4.in, reusing the shared AMBER/min.in, heat.in,
# equi.in, prod.in from the XYN pipeline (they're protein-agnostic).
#
# Cys4-Cys32 disulfide confirmed from the 1KS4 crystal: SSBOND record + 2.03 A
# SG-SG distance measured directly from coordinates -- declared explicitly
# below, same fix as tleap_Q4.in (tleap does not auto-detect disulfides).

# 1. Load the standard force fields
source leaprc.protein.ff14SB
source leaprc.water.tip3p

# 3. Load the prepared 1KS4 structure (see prep note below)
mol = loadpdb 1ks4_ready.pdb

# 4. Disulfide bond: Cys4-Cys32 (SG-SG = 2.03 A, confirmed from crystal coordinates)
bond mol.4.SG mol.32.SG

# 5. Create the solvent box and neutralize
solvateOct mol TIP3PBOX 10.0
addIons mol Na+ 0
addIons mol Cl- 0

# 6. Save files
saveamberparm mol system.prmtop system.inpcrd
quit
